# Workspaces (actions/actions_workspaces.kbd)
**workspaces + spc**      -- Show Desktops
**workspaces + toggle**   -- Desktops Toggle
**workspaces + j**        -- Next Screen
**workspaces + k**        -- Prev Screen
**workspaces + l**        -- Next Desktop
**workspaces + h**        -- Prev Desktop
**workspaces + move + j** -- Move Window To Next Screen
**workspaces + move + k** -- Move Window To Prev Screen
**workspaces + move + l** -- Move Window To Next Desktop
**workspaces + move + h** -- Move Window To Prev Desktop
